**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.tar.gz
**/faiss_index/
**/*.faiss
**/.cache/

# results that are regenerated by a full run (smoke outputs are kept)
**/results/runs/
**/results/traces/*.jsonl
!**/results/smoke/**

